#
# clang-tidy for the tests: the repository's configuration (../.clang-tidy),
# less readability-magic-numbers. A test's numbers are its inputs and the
# results it expects, read best as they are; the meter's own code, which the
# tests also compile, keeps the check.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -readability-magic-numbers
